# A single-page app: every path has to reach index.html and let the app route
# it, or a reloaded page and every shared link 404s. The share link
# (/#/r/<token>) is the one that matters most — a parent following it is the
# least likely person to work out that the URL was fine and the host was not.
#
# 200 rather than 301: rewrite, do not redirect, so the address bar keeps the
# path the app is about to read.
/*    /index.html   200
